  "notes": "This train from the Thai-Cambodian border is hauled by a diesel locomotive and has 3rd Class carriages with fans. Tickets can only be bought at the station up to two hours before departure. One carriage has room for full sized bicycles. There are two trains from the Thai-Cambodian border a day. No. 280 departs in the morning and this one in the afternoon. The outbound journey from Bangkok for this train is done by No. 275.",
